   },
   {
    "quote": "Verify the customer's identity using standard procedures.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_009",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_009",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "Entry-tier (Bronze Rewards Card, EcoCard, Business Bronze Rewards Card): $15.00.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_replacements_002",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_replacements_002",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "State a clear, specific requested limit or increase amount.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_004",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_004",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "If the requested amount exceeds the limit, inform the customer of the maximum allowed and ask them to adjust their request. Do NOT submit a request that exceeds the tier limit.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_007",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_007",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "Once the customer has confirmed a valid increase amount within their tier's limits, submit the request on their behalf using the submit_credit_limit_increase_request_7392 tool.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_007",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_007",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "This creates a formal record of the request before eligibility checks are performed. Eligibility checks are internal and not exposed to customers, so the submission must happen first.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_007",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_007",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "1. Account Age: Verify the account has been open for the minimum required days for their card tier.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_007",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_007",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "2. Cooldown Period: Use the get_credit_limit_increase_history_4829 tool to check if the customer has submitted a request within the cooldown period for their card tier.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_007",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_007",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "To retrieve a user's credit card dispute history, use the get_user_dispute_history_7291 tool.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_cards__general__016",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_cards_(general)_016",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "To check if a credit card account has any pending replacement card orders, use the get_pending_replacement_orders_5765 tool.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_replacements_005",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_replacements_005",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "6. Credit Utilization: Verify current utilization is below the maximum threshold for their card tier.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_007",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_007",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "Use the get_payment_history_6183 tool to verify the customer's payment history meets the requirement for their card tier.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_006",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_006",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "1. Use the approve_credit_limit_increase_5847 tool to approve and apply the increase.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_007",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_007",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "1. Use the deny_credit_limit_increase_5848 tool to record the denial.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_007",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_007",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "Inform the customer of the decision and provide next steps. For approvals, confirm the new credit limit. For denials, explain the reason and when they may be eligible to reapply.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_007",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_007",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "Entry Tier (Bronze Rewards Card, EcoCard, Business Bronze Rewards Card, Crypto-Cash Back Card): Maximum $2500.00",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_cards__general__015",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_cards_(general)_015",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "Entry-tier cards: Maximum increase of 25% of current credit limit per request.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_006",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_006",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "If the customer requests more than the maximum allowed for their tier, inform them of the maximum amount they are eligible for and ask if they would like to proceed with that amount instead.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_006",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_006",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "Example: An entry-tier account open for 119 days does not qualify; on day 120 and beyond it does (assuming other criteria are met).",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_005",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_005",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "This applies only if your most recent request was approved. Denied requests do not trigger a cooldown period.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_005",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_005",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "Your current credit utilization must be below the maximum threshold at the time you submit your request. Utilization at or above the threshold does not qualify.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_005",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_005",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "Entry-tier cards: Requires 6 consecutive months of on-time payments.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_006",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_006",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "You MUST check ALL of the following eligibility criteria before making an approval or denial decision as this ensures complete audit records.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_007",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_007",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "If a replacement is pending, the CLI cannot be processed until the replacement is delivered or cancelled.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_007",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_007",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "5. Account Good Standing: The account must be current with no past-due balance.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_007",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_007",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "When a customer needs to pay off their credit card balance using funds from their Rho-Bank checking account, you can process the payment directly.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_009",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_009",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "2. Look up the customer's checking account to confirm sufficient funds.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_009",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_009",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "3. Look up the customer's credit card account to confirm the outstanding balance.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_009",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_009",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "4. Confirm the payment amount with the customer and obtain authorization to transfer.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_009",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_009",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "5. Unlock the pay_credit_card_from_checking_9182 tool using unlock_discoverable_agent_tool.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_009",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_009",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "6. Call the tool using call_discoverable_agent_tool with the required arguments listed below.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_009",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_009",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "A confirmation will include the new balances for both accounts.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_009",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_009",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
    "quote": "amount (float, required): The payment amount in dollars. Must be positive and cannot exceed the checking account balance or the credit card outstanding balance.",
    "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_009",
    "doc_id": "doc_credit_cards_credit_card_account_logistics_009",
    "found": true,
    "long": false
   },
   {
